config APP_SGP4
    bool "SGP4 Satellite Prediction Module"
    default n
    select DATE_TIME
    help
      Enable satellite prediction module using SGP4.

# No "depends on APP_SGP4": NTN builds compile this module unconditionally
# (see app/CMakeLists.txt) without setting APP_SGP4.
config APP_SGP4_MIN_ELEVATION_DEG
    int "Default minimum pass elevation in degrees"
    default 50
    range 0 90
    help
      Minimum satellite elevation above the horizon for a pass to be
      considered usable by sat_data_calculate_next_pass(). Can still be
      overridden at runtime via the att_ntn sgp4_trigger shell command.

config APP_SGP4_PREDICTION_WINDOW_DAYS
    int "Pass prediction search window in days"
    default 1
    range 1 10
    help
      How many days ahead sat_data_calculate_next_pass() searches for a
      satellite pass. With high minimum elevations and few satellites the
      gap between passes can span several days, so a larger window may be
      needed. The scan runs in 10 second steps, so each extra day adds
      8640 SGP4 propagations per satellite to the worst case.
